FujiNet Go Atari 800 desktop -- milestones (plan: build-a-new-fujinet-calm-valley)

[x] M0  skeleton, staged + patched atari800 core, headless runner, boot + A/B tests, icons
[ ] M1  session without FujiNet: host thread, pacing, audio, video blits, models, ROM import
[ ] M2  FujiNet over NetSIO: runtime build, patches, watchdog, provisioning, SAM, auto-update pin
[ ] M3  media + REST: open/drives/cartridge/tape/states, import to SD
[ ] M4  input: keymap, on-screen keyboard, paste, bindings, gamepads, paddles, mice
[ ] M5  debugger engine
[ ] M6  GNOME
[ ] M7  KDE
[ ] M8  Windows
[ ] M9  macOS
[ ] M10 packaging, CI, release
